		<Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>KPG</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Likes civilizations that are not warmongers. Has disdain for warmongering civilizations.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_KUDO_LEADER_ANY_REASON_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA" Language="en_US">
			<Text>No wars, no worries! I'd love for us to keep getting along like this.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_WARNING_LEADER_ANY_REASON_AGENDA_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Must you keep fighting? Let's find something more fun to do instead...</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_LIKES_PEACE" Language="en_US">
			<Text>They are pleased to see a civilization that is not a warmonger</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DIPLO_MODIFIER_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_RIRIKA_DISLIKES_WAR" Language="en_US">
			<Text>They are unhappy with your warmongering</Text>
		</Row>

		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_NAME" Language="en_US">
			<Text>The Junior Secretaries' Hustle</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_REGLOSS_ICHIJOU_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Tiles with an improved resource provide +3 [ICON_Gold] Gold for a Bonus resource, +5 for a Strategic resource, and +10 for a Luxury resource.</Text>
		</Row>

